  speakerName: Klara
  speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
  dialogueText: 'If you need someone to stay in their current location while you
    do something else, you can tell them to wait.

    In Ilokano, ''uray ditoy''
    means ''wait here.''

    Listen carefully: uray ditoy.

    Now, try saying
    ''uray ditoy'' yourself.'
